    <node id="A Qing">
      <data key="d0">A Qing</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">A Qing is a young woman who cares deeply for her sheep named Lao Bai and shows simple innocence and joy despite hardships.&lt;SEP&gt;A Qing is a young and naive countryside girl who learns exquisite sword skills from Bai Gonggong and tends sheep with Fan Li.&lt;SEP&gt;A Qing is a skilled fighter who wields a bamboo staff and demonstrates exceptional swordsmanship and combat ability against multiple opponents.&lt;SEP&gt;A Qing is a young woman regarded as a close friend by Fan Li and Xi Shi, notable for her military skill and strong feelings toward Xi Shi.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1777375917</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="Xi Shi">
      <data key="d0">Xi Shi</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Xi Shi is the famous beauty from the Yue kingdom, associated with the Huan Sha Creek, sent into the Wu palace.&lt;SEP&gt;Xi Shi is a beautiful woman gifted to King Fuchai of Wu as part of Yue’s strategy to distract and weaken his governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Xi Shi is a woman cherished by Fan Li and A Qing, who is wounded by A Qing’s bamboo stick but admired for her beauty.&lt;SEP&gt;Xi Shi is a woman living in Guangwa Palace and shares tender moments with Fan Li.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9</data>
