      <data key="d0">Guards</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Guards are soldiers commanded by Fan Li to protect the palace gates, including 1,000 armored soldiers and 1,000 swordsmen.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6</data>
