    <node id="Bamboo Stick">
      <data key="d0">Bamboo Stick</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">A lightweight bamboo stick used by the young girl as a weapon with agile and skilled moves, capable of stabbing and disabling opponents.&lt;SEP&gt;A weapon wielded by the girl used to blind opponents and strike with high agility and skill.&lt;SEP&gt;The bamboo stick is used by A Qing and Bai Gonggong for playful combat and is the medium through which A Qing learned her swordsmanship.&lt;SEP&gt;Bamboo Stick is used by Bai Gonggong when playing or teaching sword-like techniques to A Qing during shepherding.&lt;SEP&gt;The bamboo stick is a weapon wielded by A Qing during her attack in the palace.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66</data>
