    <node id="Long Sword">
      <data key="d0">Long Sword</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Long Sword is a sword type exceeding five feet in length with a thick blade, wielded by a burly combatant in the duel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Long Sword is a sharp blade wielded by the Qingyi Swordsman, capable of cutting heavy weapons and inflicting serious injuries.&lt;SEP&gt;A sharp, long sword wielded by the guards and Wu Country swordsmen, capable of precise and deadly strikes including splitting goats and attacking enemies.</data>
