      <data key="d2">The official is a figure commanding the sword practitioners to uphold the way of the sword, possessing a stern and authoritative demeanor.&lt;SEP&gt;The Official is a tall, skinny man around forty years old who commands the Wu-Yue swordsmen to the second duel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Official is a court attendant standing beside Wangzhe who announces sword contest conditions and praises swordsmanship.</data>
