    <node id="Sword">
      <data key="d0">Sword</data>
      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The sword is a weapon used by the duelists, including a long sword more than five feet long with a thick blade.&lt;SEP&gt;A thin and sharp sword with a trembling blade that appears fragile but is exceptionally sharp and durable against heavy weapons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c903f2e907674391708383e3d1afe7fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e</data>
